      "scope": "Finite SC source-ordered retirement composition, not C refinement. Local resize publication is separate from root cleanup: root seals and independently admitted readers leave before observed drain and root join publication. Environmental join errors remain hypothetical; Darwin detached-live-thread TSD controls deliberately breach joinability ownership and do not prove supported error reachability or successful retry. Sticky root preserves its first error and rejects setup/cleanup reentry. Native drain requires actual seal-CAS captured leases >0 and observed post-close leases 0, not before/after producer activity. No arbitrary-generation/weak-memory/public-only/full-lifecycle admission."
